{"type":"message","id":"c618fbda","parentId":"f0794d91","timestamp":"2026-04-02T00:26:32.796Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know which skills are currently installed. Let me list them.","thinkingSignature":"85ac9418f6db9e75494215b4980e0635ed9565fc41aa407d0e108f6302488757"},{"type":"text","text":"当前已安装的 Skills：\n\n**自建 Skills**（`~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/`）\n- `biology-tutor` — 初中生物辅导\n- `geography-tutor` — 初中地理辅导\n- `language-learning-tutor` — 多语言 AI 导师\n- `self-improving-agent` — 自我复盘与改进\n- `yuwen-tutor` — 初中语文学习导师\n- `skill-interview-builder` — 访谈式 Skill 构建器 ✨（刚装）\n\n**飞书插件 Skills**（`~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/`）\n- `feishu-bitable` — 多维表格管理\n- `feishu-calendar` — 日历与日程\n- `feishu-channel-rules` — 飞书频道规则\n- `feishu-create-doc` — 创建云文档\n- `feishu-fetch-doc` — 获取文档内容\n- `feishu-im-read` — 消息读取\n- `feishu-task` — 任务管理\n- `feishu-troubleshoot` — 飞书问题排查\n- `feishu-update-doc` — 更新云文档\n\n共 **9 个自建 + 9 个飞书插件**。有什么想深入了解的？🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":296,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":43358,"totalTokens":43788,"cost":{"input":0.0000402,"output":0.00035519999999999996,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.01625925,"total":0.01665465}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775089584592,"responseId":"061ceab192e1ac9043a3453749f6bd82"}}
